@startuml NINA-AES_Sequence_AESVerification
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  NINA-AES — Séquence : Vérification transfrontalière AES
'  Bloc B · Acteur principal : Autorité Burkina Faso
'  Auteur : Étudiant UQAR · Avril 2026
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title Séquence — Vérification AES transfrontalière (Bloc B)

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  ActorBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  ActorBorderColor #D97706
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  FontName Inter
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  BorderColor #059669
}

actor "Autorité BFA\n(agent frontière)" as BFA #FED7AA
participant "Gateway BFA\n(BCID-AES)" as GwBFA #FCE7F3
participant "Gateway MLI\n(interop-service\n:3006)" as GwMLI #DBEAFE
participant "Identity Service\n(MLI :3001)" as Identity #E0E7FF
participant "AI Service\n(fuzzy matching)" as AI #FEE2E2
participant "Audit Service\n(:3007)" as Audit #FEF3C7
database "PostgreSQL\nMLI" as DB #FFFBEB

== 1. Émission de la requête ==

BFA -> GwBFA : Scanne carte AES /\nsaisit { nina, lastName, birthDate }
activate GwBFA
GwBFA -> GwBFA : Crée requête JWS Ed25519\nclé privée BFA → header `kid: bfa-2026`
GwBFA -> GwBFA : Ajoute correlationId UUID v7\n+ timestamp signé

== 2. Transport mTLS BFA → MLI ==

GwBFA -> GwMLI : POST /aes/verify\n(mTLS — cert BFA présenté)\nBody = AESVerificationRequest signé JWS
activate GwMLI
note right of GwMLI
  Étape 2a : termination TLS mutuelle
  Étape 2b : validation chaîne X.509
  contre AES_CA_PATH (root commune AES)
  Étape 2c : vérification JWS Ed25519
  avec clé publique BFA pré-enregistrée
end note

GwMLI -> GwMLI : Vérifie cert client\n(Subject CN = "AES-BFA-GW-01")
GwMLI -> GwMLI : Vérifie signature JWS\nclé publique BFA (rotation 90j)
GwMLI -> GwMLI : Anti-replay : window 30s\n+ correlationId vu ?

alt cert / JWS / replay invalide
  GwMLI --> GwBFA : 401 Unauthorized\n{ error: INVALID_SIGNATURE }
  GwBFA --> BFA : ❌ Échec vérification
end

== 3. Recherche identité ==

GwMLI -> Identity : POST /search/aes\n{ nina, lastName, birthDate, requesterCountry: BFA }
activate Identity
Identity -> DB : SELECT * FROM citizens\nWHERE nina = $1
activate DB
DB --> Identity : Citizen ou null
deactivate DB

alt NINA introuvable
  Identity -> Audit : audit.aes.no_match\n(targetNinaHash = SHA256(nina))
  Identity --> GwMLI : { result: NO_MATCH, confidence: 0 }
end

== 4. Fuzzy matching nom de famille ==

Identity -> AI : POST /fuzzy-match\n{ stored: "Touré", queried: "Toure" }
activate AI
AI -> AI : Normalisation NFD + ASCII fold
AI -> AI : Jaro-Winkler + Levenshtein
AI -> AI : Score combiné 0-100
AI --> Identity : { score: 96.2, threshold_passed: true }
deactivate AI

Identity -> Identity : Score global =\n0.5 × ninaMatch (binaire)\n+ 0.3 × lastNameScore\n+ 0.2 × birthDateMatch

== 5. Audit + journalisation ==

Identity -> Audit : Publish "audit.aes.verified"\n{ requesterCountry, targetNinaHash, result, confidence, ipAddress }
activate Audit
Audit -> Audit : Append AesVerificationLog\n+ chaîne Merkle
Audit --> Identity : ack
deactivate Audit
deactivate Identity

== 6. Réponse signée ==

Identity --> GwMLI : { result: MATCH, confidence: 96.2,\n  matchFields: ["nina","lastName","birthDate"] }
GwMLI -> GwMLI : Construit AESVerificationResponse\n{ verified, confidence, matchFields, timestamp }
GwMLI -> GwMLI : Signe Ed25519 (clé MLI)\n→ JWS detached signature

GwMLI --> GwBFA : 200 OK\nAESVerificationResponse signé\n(mTLS retour)
deactivate GwMLI

GwBFA -> GwBFA : Vérifie signature MLI\nclé publique pré-enregistrée
GwBFA --> BFA : ✅ Identité vérifiée\n(score 96 %, NINA + nom + DDN)
deactivate GwBFA

note over BFA, DB
  🔒 Aucune donnée personnelle en clair côté BFA après l'échange.
     Seuls : NINA hashé + booléen + score de confiance + timestamp.
     Le contrôle conforme au RGPD-like (principe de minimisation).
  ⏱ Latence cible : < 800 ms (P99) sous 50 req/s soutenues.
  🛡 Anti-replay : correlationId conservés 30s en Redis (TTL).
end note

@enduml
